4.2.8.2
Editable Treeviews with Draft Capabilities
In this chapter, you will be guided through all steps necessary to implement editable treeviews based on the
implementation type managed with draft of the ABAP RESTful Application Programming Model (RAP).
Why and When to Use Editable Treeviews
In the context of the RAP, a treeview visualizes data modeled by a CDS hierarchy, for example, by using a SAP
Fiori Elements treetable. If you have the business need to display or edit hierarchical relationships, such as
those between employees and their respective managers, you can use RAP to efficiently create treeviews and
to display them on your SAP Fiori User Interface (UI).
